  "description": "Harnesser of Storms triggers on its controller's noncreature or Otter spell, may exile the top card of their library to be played until end of turn, and triggers only once each turn, even when its controller declined the exile (CR 603.2, 603.5, 406.1, 611.2a, 305.1)",
  "note": "Grizzly Bears (a non-Otter creature spell) and bob's Shock (another player's instant) must not trigger it: an unasked optional prompt fails the run. A second noncreature spell in turns 1, 3 and 5 shows the limit, the turn-5 one after a declined trigger on Divination (a noncreature, nonartifact spell), which then draws the card left on top. The exiled Mountain is played from exile in turn 1; the Plains exiled in turn 3 is refused in turn 5, with alice's land play unused. Libraries hold distinct names so each card is countable.",
